* Queues read by MQ source connectors. The developer configuration of the image grants the "app"
* user (group mqclient) access to DEV.** only, so connector queues get an explicit authority record.
DEFINE QLOCAL('ORDERS.IN') REPLACE
SET AUTHREC PROFILE('ORDERS.**') OBJTYPE(QUEUE) GROUP('mqclient') AUTHADD(BROWSE,GET,INQ,PUT)
